@host = http://localhost:5048

### 省略 ip 参数即查请求者自己的归属地
GET {{host}}/api/ip/region
Accept: application/json

###

### 国内地址：中国 江苏省 南京市 CN
GET {{host}}/api/ip/region?ip=114.114.114.114
Accept: application/json

###

### 境外地址：United States California Google LLC US
GET {{host}}/api/ip/region?ip=8.8.8.8
Accept: application/json

###

### 保留地址：Reserved
GET {{host}}/api/ip/region?ip=192.168.1.1
Accept: application/json

###

### 库边界：末段 255.255.255.0/24 也应命中（Reserved）
GET {{host}}/api/ip/region?ip=255.255.255.255
Accept: application/json

###

### 预期 400：IPv6 不在离线库收录范围
GET {{host}}/api/ip/region?ip=2001:db8::1
Accept: application/json

###

### 预期 400：非法地址
GET {{host}}/api/ip/region?ip=abc
Accept: application/json
